+
+### Parallel Execution Groups
+
+No parallel groups are safe from the available evidence:
+
+- S001 establishes the proposals that S002 reviews.
+- S002 establishes the reviewed action state that S003 confirms.
+
+### Critical Path
+
+S001 → S002 → S003 → Complete
+
+### Resource Allocation (Example)
+
+- Phase 1: one developer
+- Phase 2: one developer
+- Phase 3: one developer
+- Phase 4: covered within each story
