+
+## Risk Mitigation
+
+| Story | Risk | Mitigation |
+|------|------|------------|
+| S001 | Extracted proposals appear in the wrong workspace | Persist and test `workspace_id` ownership across transcript and proposal records. |
+| S002 | Review UI reveals another workspace's data | Scope every review load to the active workspace and exercise a cross-workspace negative case. |
+| S003 | A draft action becomes confirmed without deliberate consent | Require explicit confirmation and validate all required fields before recording audit data. |
